            "line": 962,
            "text": "theorem Pi_ideal (w : ResetWitness d K) (eta : ℝ) {y : ℝ} (hy : y ≤ 0) :\n    Pi w (y, eta) = SchedulePressure.axisPressure d eta +\n      (5 / 2) * d.core.P ^ 2 * shape eta ^ 2 * Real.exp (y / 5)"
